<title>POLAND: NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 500 MLN 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 500 MLN 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland offered to sell 500 million zlotys of its 273-day NBP-bills, the bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - NOV 7, 1996</p>
<p>Maturity of bills offered - AUG 7, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
